<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Talli\" title=\"Talli\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/25px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/38px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/50px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Quartermaster Talli\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/25px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Talli\" title=\"Talli\">Quartermaster Talli</a> within the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201022\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2609/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40645/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10427/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1428039/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.910      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   62.910      1 -total\n 44.31%   27.874     11 Template:Icon_text\n 38.78%   24.394     27 Template:Trim\n 26.76%   16.835      1 Template:PageSeo\n 26.66%   16.772      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 18.18%   11.434      3 Template:Uid\n 17.59%   11.066      2 Template:R\n 14.33%    9.012      5 Template:Icon_link\n  9.71%    6.10